.mb-3
  %label.form-label Select co-signer(s)
  %select.form-select{name: "cosign_invitee_ids[]", multiple: true, required: true, size: 8}
    - Array(groups).each do |group|
      %optgroup{label: group.label}
        - group.teammates.each do |teammate|
          %option{value: teammate.id}= teammate.person.display_name
  %small.form-text.text-muted First Yes wins. Others can still give feedback after co-sign closes.
